---
title: 3. summary_agent.get_state(config) → checkpoint의 messages 확인
---
graph TD
    classDef codeBlock fill:#1e1e1e,color:#d4d4d4,stroke:#555,stroke-width:2px,text-align:left,font-family:monospace;
    classDef agentBlock fill:#1e1e1e,color:#569cd6,stroke:#569cd6,stroke-width:3px,text-align:left,font-family:"Noto Sans Mono CJK KR",monospace,font-size:16px;
    classDef stateBlock fill:#1e1e1e,color:#b5cea8,stroke:#6a9955,stroke-width:2px,text-align:left,font-family:monospace;
    classDef execBlock fill:#1e1e1e,color:#ce9178,stroke:#ce9178,stroke-width:2px,text-align:left,font-family:monospace;
    classDef resultBlock fill:#1e1e1e,color:#9cdcfe,stroke:#4fc1ff,stroke-width:2px,text-align:left,font-family:monospace;

    Agent["summary_agent<br/>└─ checkpointer = InMemorySaver()"]:::agentBlock
    Config["config = {<br/>  'configurable': {<br/>    'thread_id': 'europe-package'<br/>  }<br/>}"]:::stateBlock

    GetState["summary_agent.get_state(config)"]:::execBlock
    Values[".values['messages']"]:::stateBlock
    Messages["messages =<br/>summary_agent.get_state(config).values['messages']"]:::resultBlock

    Loop["for index, message in enumerate(<br/>    messages, start=1<br/>):"]:::execBlock

    Preview["preview = str(message.content)<br/>    .replace('\\n', ' ')[:240]"]:::codeBlock

    Print["print(<br/>    f'{index:02d}. [{message.type}] {preview}'<br/>)"]:::codeBlock

    Note["확인 포인트<br/>├─ 임계치 초과 뒤 오래된 원문 일부가 요약 컨텍스트로 대체될 수 있음<br/>├─ 최근 메시지는 유지됨<br/>└─ 특정 내부 문자열 형식보다 messages 상태의 의미를 확인"]:::stateBlock

    Agent == "1. checkpoint를 가진 Agent" ==> GetState
    Config == "2. 조회할 thread 지정" ==> GetState
    GetState == "3. 저장된 Agent state" ==> Values
    Values == "4. messages만 꺼냄" ==> Messages
    Messages == "5. 순회" ==> Loop
    Loop == "6. content를 240자 미리보기로 변환" ==> Preview
    Preview == "7. type과 함께 출력" ==> Print
    Messages -. "상태 해석" .-> Note
